&Q000583

{1 = 1-2}
1.	Say to @wPN{Enlil-massu}  
2.	what @wPN{Inim-Inana} says: 

{3 = 3-15}
3.	They told me everything and I am pleased beyond exaggeration. 
4.	May the precious protective power of a lifetime; 
5.	@wPN{Lugal-šu}, @wPN{Nabi-Enlil} and @wPN{Enlil-alsag}, the scholars who precede you; 
6.	and @wDN{Ninimma}, your own goddess, 
7.	and @wDN{Nisaba}, 
8.	the lady of broad wisdom, 
9.	give wisdom to you. 
10.	You did not know what was written on the tablet or that the city would be unforthcoming. 
11.	@wPN{Lu-gena} is sending you two shekels of silver, 
12.	one garment and two sashes. 
13.	Accept them. 
14.	But your mother should not touch the remaining assets. 
15.	It is urgent. 
